# attacker -> {defender: multiplier}.  Anything omitted is 1x.
# DARK and STEEL are the two types the second generation introduced, and they
# bring the only zero-multiplier matchups in the table: PSYCHIC cannot touch
# DARK, and POISON cannot touch STEEL.
